#
# vmpasswd
#
# This file contains the list of VM IDs of encrypted virtual machines and the
# passwords for each.
#
# The file contains lines, with each line representing a VM. The format of the
# line is Machine ID followed by whitespace character(s) (spaces and/or tabs)
# and the password for the virtual machine, e.g.:
#
#       01234ABCDE      secretpass
#
# Lines with a '#' are comment lines and are ignored. Empty lines (lines that
# are simply newlines) are also ignored
#
#